    LLM: "1. **Bring-In**: The player with the HIGHEST door card (1st up card) must pay a mandatory bring-in bet. 2. **Betting Rounds**: Five rounds of betting (starting after 3rd street). 3. **Showdown**: Players reveal 7 cards; best 5-card 'Low' hand wins.",
    Player: "1. **Bring-In**: The player with the HIGHEST door card (1st up card) must pay a mandatory bring-in bet. 2. **Betting Rounds**: Five rounds of betting (starting after 3rd street). 3. **Showdown**: Players reveal 7 cards; best 5-card 'Low' hand wins.",
